# Ref: CE v5.30 p.16, "Step phrasing (GRV)": "A Step may be enriched at
# playtime by a certain amount of notes determined by phrases." p.27: phrase
# #0 plays the step as-is; a selected phrase adds extras on top of the base.
seed 1
page.tracks 0 enabled
phrase 0 note 0 pit +7
phrase 0 note 0 enabled 1
track 0 step 0 phrase 1
play 1 step
expect note track=0 pit=0
expect note track=0 pit=+7
